Recruiter > Web: Select job and upload CSV
Web > API: Map and preview columns
API > PostgreSQL: Save durable job and rows
Recruiter > Web: Confirm with idempotency key
Web > API: Confirm import
API > Queue: Dispatch opaque work IDs
Queue > Worker: Claim durable row
Worker > Drive: Rate-limited public PDF fetch
Worker > PrivateStore: Quarantine, scan, promote
Worker > PostgreSQL: Match candidate/create application
Web > API: Poll progress/results
Recruiter > Web: Enter natural-language search
Web > API: Interpret query
API > Grok: Query plus restricted DSL schema
Grok > API: Candidate-free DSL JSON
API > API: Validate fields/operators/values/sort
API > PostgreSQL: Parameterized typed search
API > Web: Editable chips and results
